---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Terms of Use — SnapJar';
const description = 'Terms for using the SnapJar app, including the no-advice nature of the calculators and acceptable use.';
const updated = 'July 2026';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <main>
    <div class="wrap doc-page">
      <p class="doc-kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="doc-h1">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="doc-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <div class="doc-tldr">
        <b>The short version:</b> SnapJar is a free set of tools that run <b>on your device</b>. Use them for anything lawful. The results — including any calculator output — are for your information only and are <b>not professional advice</b>, so please double-check anything important.
      </div>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">1. Use of the app</h2>
      <p>SnapJar provides free utilities — PDF tools, a scanner, OCR, converters, calculators and image tools — that run on your device. You may use them for lawful personal and commercial purposes. The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">2. Not financial or professional advice</h2>
      <p>Our calculators are computational tools that return results based solely on the values you enter. They are for general information only and do not constitute financial, tax, legal or other professional advice. Always verify important figures and consult a qualified professional before making decisions.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">3. Accuracy</h2>
      <p>We aim for correct formulas and results but do not guarantee accuracy for every scenario, currency or jurisdiction. You are responsible for confirming results before relying on them.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">4. Your content is yours</h2>
      <p>The documents, scans and files you create or open in SnapJar belong to you and stay on your device. You are responsible for the files you process and for keeping your own backups — SnapJar has no servers and cannot recover anything for you.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, SnapJar and its operators are not liable for any loss or damage arising from use of the app or reliance on any result it produces.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">6. Advertising</h2>
      <p>SnapJar is free because it is supported by advertising shown through Google AdMob. By using the app you acknowledge that ads may be displayed. Ads never have access to your files or documents.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">7. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the app after changes means you accept the revised terms.</p>

      <h2 class="doc-h2">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Email <b>contact.snapjar@gmail.com</b>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
